462:/**
463: * Re-export of Bun.env with undefined-safe indexing.
464: *
465: * Bun.env's runtime type is Record<string, string | undefined>; the historical
466: * export asserted Record<string, string> and every caller assumes string.
467: * Rather than a mass signature change, we proxy the underlying object so
468: * reading an unset name returns "" instead of undefined.
